    "manas-2010:p1177:b001:l006": "Losing wings metaphor refers to loss of mount; no literal wings added to the mule.",
    "manas-2010:p1177:b001:l014": "жолум үй temporary small herder/traveler shelter, axe-size comparison retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1177:b001:l032": "буткул variant быткыл, uneven hollow, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/буткул/. Lake-containing hollow is qualified reading of compressed lake/eye simile; no raw emendation.",
